Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["\<\
The superfluid boson singlet state of the gauge-covariant spinor field on the \
3+1 manifold of the Lorentz super-loop\
\>", "Title",ExpressionUUID->"611eef84-a225-465c-ba57-cf55e941e5b8"],

Cell["\<\
PROJECT spacetimes, folder Revision_HS_CJT_and_Kohn-Sham. The notebook \
superfluid.nb, prepared for Patrick Lee Nash, Ph.D.\
\>", "Subtitle",ExpressionUUID->"6f90a32f-fefe-47ef-95d1-e9666ed8e95e"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "This notebook is the Wolfram Language companion of the manuscript of the \
solution in the same folder, written so that a first-year graduate student in \
physics can follow every step. It states the problem and the conventions, \
defines every object that a computation needs, writes out the equations that \
can be executed, and executes them: the algebra of the manifold M31 and of \
the Lorentz super-loop, the spinor field and the gauge group GEE with its \
covariant derivatives, the field equations and their analytic solutions, the \
condensation of the spinor field into the superfluid boson singlet state by \
the methods of Hubbard and Stratonovich (HS), of Kohn and Sham (KS) and of \
Cornwall, Jackiw and Tomboulis (CJT), the effective Lagrangians and the \
Mexican hat, the breaking of the symmetry and the masses of the gauge bosons, \
the surviving symmetry with its massless photon, and the dynamics. Every time \
integration in this notebook is done by the method IDA of the function ",
 StyleBox["NDSolve",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 "; no fixed-step integrator (such as the fourth-order Runge-Kutta method) is \
used anywhere."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"5a24f9c3-4020-4c38-a3af-08c7b9e9ba5f"],

Cell["\<\
How to use it. Open the notebook in Wolfram (version 15 or later; it was \
evaluated with Wolfram 15.0.1) and choose Evaluation > Evaluate Notebook. The \
cells are evaluated in order. Nothing outside this notebook is read: every \
definition and every program is inside it. Every check prints one line that \
begins with PASS or FAIL, and the last chapter lists all checks.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"0d63c003-aa33-4fe6-921c-a03028c6b9d5"],

Cell["\<\
How to read it. A text cell explains, in words and formulas, what the next \
input cell does and why. Inside the code, comments (* like this *) explain \
each step, and every symbol of the code that stands for an object of the \
physics has a comment with its printed name and its meaning the first time it \
is defined. A symbol of the printed text with the suffix LL is taken \
unchanged from the earlier work of the project on the super-loop; a symbol \
with the suffix SF is introduced by this solution.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"c884610c-0610-45da-a14f-620e680c76c2"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The checks and their counterparts. Every computation of this notebook is \
also done by a program in Rust and by a program in Python, in the folders ",
 StyleBox["rust/",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " and ",
 StyleBox["python/",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " of the folder of the solution; users without a Wolfram license can follow \
the solution with those programs. Every check of this notebook carries the \
identifier of the same check in the Rust program with the prefix W (for \
example WA-3 is the check A-3 of the Rust program ",
 StyleBox["sf_part1",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " and of the Python program ",
 StyleBox["sf_part1.py",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 "), and the line that it prints names both counterparts. The notebook \
computes its values itself, by methods of the Wolfram Language (exact \
arithmetic where the Rust program computes in floating point, symbolic \
derivatives where it differentiates automatically, the solvers of the Wolfram \
Language where it uses its own); the numbers agree with those of the two \
programs within the tolerances stated in each check."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"9a956bd7-3775-41db-ac88-bb08e860fc1b"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["0. The register of the checks", "Chapter",ExpressionUUID->"56776d87-b77a-4c65-a48d-57a9ced03e47"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The next cell defines the functions that record and print a check. ",
 StyleBox["check[id, text, dev, tol, rust, python]",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " records a numerical check: it passes when the measured deviation ",
 StyleBox["dev",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " is at most the tolerance ",
 StyleBox["tol",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 "; ",
 StyleBox["rust",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " and ",
 StyleBox["python",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " are the identifiers of the same check in the Rust and in the Python \
program. ",
 StyleBox["checkTrue[id, text, ok, detail, rust, python]",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " records a check that is decided by facts (a count, an exact identity), \
with a short ",
 StyleBox["detail",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 ". Both append an association to the list ",
 StyleBox["SFNB`Test`$Results",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 ", the register of all checks of this notebook, and print one line. The \
function ",
 StyleBox["sci",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " writes a number with four significant digits in the form ",
 StyleBox["2.857e-8",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 ", as the reports of the Rust and the Python programs do."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"13871260-066f-4c05-8269-07b428e14f7c"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
    "the", " ", "register", " ", "of", " ", "the", " ", "checks", " ", "of", " ",
      "this", " ", 
     RowBox[{"notebook", ":", " ", 
      RowBox[{"one", " ", "association", " ", "per", " ", "check"}]}]}], ",", 
    " ", 
    RowBox[{"in", " ", "the", " ", "order", " ", "of", " ", "evaluation"}]}], 
   " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"SFNB`Test`$Results", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", "}"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"sci", "[", "x", "]"}], ":", " ", 
      RowBox[{
      "the", " ", "number", " ", "x", " ", "with", " ", "four", " ", 
       "significant", " ", "digits"}]}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{
     "written", " ", "as", " ", "mantissa", " ", "e", " ", "exponent", " ", 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"for", " ", "example", " ", "2.857", "e"}], "-", "8"}], 
       ")"}]}]}], " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"sci", "[", 
      RowBox[{"x_", "?", "NumericQ"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"y", " ", "=", " ", 
          RowBox[{"N", "[", "x", "]"}]}], ",", " ", "e", ",", " ", "m"}], 
        "}"}], ",", "\n", "   ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"If", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"y", " ", "==", " ", "0"}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"Return", "[", 
           RowBox[{"\"\<0\>\"", ",", " ", "Module"}], "]"}]}], "]"}], ";", 
        "\n", "   ", 
        RowBox[{"e", " ", "=", " ", 
         RowBox[{"Floor", "[", 
          RowBox[{"Log10", "[", 
           RowBox[{"Abs", "[", "y", "]"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ";", " ", 
        RowBox[{"m", " ", "=", " ", 
         RowBox[{"Round", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"y", "/", 
            RowBox[{"10.", "^", "e"}]}], ",", " ", "0.001"}], "]"}]}], ";", 
        "\n", "   ", 
        RowBox[{"If", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"Abs", "[", "m", "]"}], " ", ">=", " ", "10"}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"m", " ", "=", " ", 
            RowBox[{"m", "/", "10"}]}], ";", " ", 
           RowBox[{"e", " ", "=", " ", 
            RowBox[{"e", " ", "+", " ", "1"}]}]}]}], "]"}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
        
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"ToString", "[", 
          RowBox[{"NumberForm", "[", 
           RowBox[{"m", ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"{", 
             RowBox[{"4", ",", " ", "3"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], "]"}], " ", "<>", 
         " ", "\"\<e\>\"", " ", "<>", " ", 
         RowBox[{"ToString", "[", "e", "]"}]}]}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"checkHook", "[", "]"}], ":", " ", 
      RowBox[{"called", " ", "after", " ", "every", " ", "check"}]}], ";", 
     " ", 
     RowBox[{"it", " ", "does", " ", "nothing", " ", "here", " ", 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{
       "a", " ", "dry", " ", "run", " ", "of", " ", "the", " ", "code", " ", 
        "without", " ", "the", " ", "front", " ", "end", "\n", "   ", "uses", 
        " ", "it", " ", "to", " ", "print", " ", "the", " ", "computing", " ",
         "time", " ", "of", " ", "each", " ", "check"}], ")"}]}]}], " ", 
    "*)"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"checkHook", "[", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", "Null"}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"check", "[", 
       RowBox[{
       "id", ",", " ", "text", ",", " ", "dev", ",", " ", "tol", ",", " ", 
        "rust", ",", " ", "python"}], "]"}], ":", " ", 
      RowBox[{"a", " ", "numerical", " ", "check"}]}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"passed", " ", "when", " ", "dev"}], " ", "<=", " ", "tol"}]}], 
    " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"check", "[", 
      RowBox[{"id_String", ",", " ", "text_String", ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"dev_", "?", "NumericQ"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"tol_", "?", "NumericQ"}], ",", " ", "rust_String", ",", " ", 
       "python_String"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"ok", " ", "=", " ", 
         RowBox[{"TrueQ", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"N", "[", "dev", "]"}], " ", "<=", " ", "tol"}], "]"}]}], 
        "}"}], ",", "\n", "   ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"AppendTo", "[", 
         RowBox[{"SFNB`Test`$Results", ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"<|", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"\"\<id\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "id"}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<pass\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "ok"}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<deviation\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
             RowBox[{"N", "[", "dev", "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<tolerance\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
             RowBox[{"N", "[", "tol", "]"}]}], ",", "\n", "      ", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<text\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "text"}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<rust\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "rust"}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<python\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "python"}]}], "|>"}]}], 
         "]"}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
        RowBox[{"Print", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"If", "[", 
           RowBox[{
           "ok", ",", " ", "\"\<PASS \>\"", ",", " ", "\"\<FAIL \>\""}], 
           "]"}], ",", " ", "id", ",", " ", "\"\<  deviation \>\"", ",", " ", 
          
          RowBox[{"sci", "[", "dev", "]"}], ",", " ", "\"\< (tolerance \>\"", 
          ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"sci", "[", "tol", "]"}], ",", " ", "\"\<): \>\"", ",", " ",
           "text", ",", "\n", "     ", "\"\<   [the same check: Rust \>\"", ",",
           " ", "rust", ",", " ", "\"\<, Python \>\"", ",", " ", "python", ",",
           " ", "\"\<]\>\""}], "]"}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
        RowBox[{"checkHook", "[", "]"}], ";", " ", "ok"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], 
   "\n", 
   RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"checkTrue", "[", 
       RowBox[{
       "id", ",", " ", "text", ",", " ", "ok", ",", " ", "detail", ",", " ", 
        "rust", ",", " ", "python"}], "]"}], ":", " ", 
      RowBox[{"a", " ", "check", " ", "decided", " ", "by", " ", "facts"}]}], 
     ";", " ", 
     RowBox[{"detail", " ", "states", " ", "them"}]}], " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"checkTrue", "[", 
      RowBox[{
      "id_String", ",", " ", "text_String", ",", " ", "ok_", ",", " ", 
       "detail_String", ",", " ", "rust_String", ",", " ", "python_String"}], 
      "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"pass", " ", "=", " ", 
         RowBox[{"TrueQ", "[", "ok", "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n", "   ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"AppendTo", "[", 
         RowBox[{"SFNB`Test`$Results", ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"<|", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"\"\<id\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "id"}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<pass\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "pass"}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<deviation\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
             RowBox[{"Missing", "[", "\"\<NotNumerical\>\"", "]"}]}], ",", 
            " ", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<tolerance\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
             RowBox[{"Missing", "[", "\"\<NotNumerical\>\"", "]"}]}], ",", 
            "\n", "      ", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<text\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
             RowBox[{
             "text", " ", "<>", " ", "\"\< [\>\"", " ", "<>", " ", "detail", 
              " ", "<>", " ", "\"\<]\>\""}]}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<rust\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "rust"}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<python\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "python"}]}], "|>"}]}], 
         "]"}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
        RowBox[{"Print", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"If", "[", 
           RowBox[{
           "pass", ",", " ", "\"\<PASS \>\"", ",", " ", "\"\<FAIL \>\""}], 
           "]"}], ",", " ", "id", ",", " ", "\"\<  \>\"", ",", " ", "text", ",",
           " ", "\"\< [\>\"", ",", " ", "detail", ",", 
          " ", "\"\<]   [the same check: Rust \>\"", ",", " ", "rust", ",", 
          " ", "\"\<, Python \>\"", ",", " ", "python", ",", 
          " ", "\"\<]\>\""}], "]"}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
        RowBox[{"checkHook", "[", "]"}], ";", " ", "pass"}]}], "]"}]}], 
    ";"}]}]}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[1]:=",ExpressionUUID->"18c39ab0-97bb-40ba-814e-0581d4e673fd"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
Part I. The manifold M31, the spinor field, GEE, the field equations and four \
analytic solutions\
\>", "Chapter",ExpressionUUID->"12af1ff1-5b88-410a-9af5-f0204cb8ad86"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Part I treats items 1 to 5 of the problem (Sections 1 to 7 of the \
manuscript): the manifold M31 of the Lorentz super-loop, the spinor fields on \
it and the Dirac field, the gauge group GEE and its covariant derivatives, \
the Lagrangian with its field equations, and analytic solutions of four \
simple cases. Its checks are those of the Python program ",
 StyleBox["sf_part1.py",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 ", which repeats a part of the checks of the Rust program ",
 StyleBox["sf_part1",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 "; the random test values of this notebook come from the generator of the \
Wolfram Language with the seed 20261121, so they differ from those of the two \
programs, as theirs differ from each other."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"cee7157c-5d53-4e9d-9b35-5fddb41965f8"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["I.1 Conventions, units and the common objects", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"7700078b-f7cd-457c-ab8d-0157339fe5a3"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Units.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " Planck's constant and the speed of light are 1; energies, masses and \
momenta are measured in units of the momentum cutoff ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox["\[CapitalLambda]", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", "1"}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "8291a3ee-777a-45da-804e-f8451fe6e8c5"],
 ", lengths and times in units of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"1", "/", 
    SubscriptBox["\[CapitalLambda]", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "abe47437-8319-4ef2-9259-ddf5f92193b6"],
 ". The mass of the spinor field is ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["m", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", "0.2"}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "306f621d-3dd5-4370-a19f-68506a937831"],
 "."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"40800a6f-0f8d-4b12-90ca-70e98d53c818"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Indices.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["p", "TI"], ",", 
    SuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["p", "TI"], "\[Prime]"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "578ef3b8-6495-4c0b-9b2d-808ac3b536ef"],
 " run over the four coordinates of M31 (0 is the time), ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["j", "TI"], ",", 
    SuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["j", "TI"], "\[Prime]"], ",", 
    SuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["j", "TI"], "\[Prime]\[Prime]"]}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1c10e1bc-29cf-4b42-8b7b-e88e611daff7"],
 " over the three space coordinates, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"\[Iota]", ",", 
    SuperscriptBox["\[Iota]", "\[Prime]"], ",", 
    SuperscriptBox["\[Iota]", "\[Prime]\[Prime]"]}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "fa9d4b5b-1895-4171-a120-894968f7b4a8"],
 " over the three directions of isospin (an internal direction, not a \
direction in space), and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["c", "TI"], ",", 
    SuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["c", "TI"], "\[Prime]"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6cef4e27-7471-44ce-b143-7e1c0b70f924"],
 " over the eight components of the spinor field. The letter ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox["i", "TI"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "60584f7f-2c14-4f72-a71d-2d0e834283e1"],
 " is always the imaginary unit. The Minkowski metric is ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Eta]", 
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["p", "TI"], 
      SuperscriptBox[
       StyleBox["p", "TI"], "\[Prime]"]}], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    StyleBox["diag",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{"1", ",", 
      RowBox[{"-", "1"}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"-", "1"}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"-", "1"}]}], ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "d5d6f240-ffa0-437c-8eb0-89aaf2319b6d"],
 "."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"6ba310c6-deac-4fb3-850a-ca0b22853453"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Matrices.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox["\[Sigma]", "0", 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "9e0ecadb-2757-4b78-ae6b-88c77a7828fb"],
 " is the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"2", "\[Times]", "2"}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7bbd5d2a-1747-48c1-9629-3c84c1cad275"],
 " unit matrix and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Sigma]", "1", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], ",", 
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Sigma]", "2", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], ",", 
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Sigma]", "3", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6d9149f0-4f7d-4346-b49a-228dfdf14959"],
 " are the Pauli matrices; acting on isospin they are written ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox["\[Tau]", "\[Iota]", 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5ede7bbb-850c-4caa-a6ee-09df83b68df4"],
 ". ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["E",
      FontFamily->"Helvetica",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    StyleBox["i", "TI"], 
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Sigma]", "2", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5180a0e1-046f-47bb-80ee-303b2126d051"],
 ". The Dirac matrices are those of the chiral basis, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox["\[Gamma]", 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], "0"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "724cb625-f4e6-4143-b9a0-5a5a26d14888"],
 " with the blocks ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox["\[Sigma]", "0", 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "cafb29d9-8e1c-4cc2-8b8b-4b4bd79d20bb"],
 " off the diagonal and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox["\[Gamma]", 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["j", "TI"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "cb951a5a-9fd6-4972-b694-90a38329c001"],
 " with the blocks ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox["\[Sigma]", 
    StyleBox["j", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "9d5393b0-fd9b-424b-b255-b459f4957334"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"-", 
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Sigma]", 
     StyleBox["j", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5b0bdf0c-c105-489b-9788-e9b5df03721a"],
 "; ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Gamma]", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["ch",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    StyleBox["i", "TI"], 
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Gamma]", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], "0"], 
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Gamma]", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], "1"], 
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Gamma]", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], "2"], 
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Gamma]", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], "3"], "\[LongEqual]", 
    StyleBox["diag",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"-", "1"}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"-", "1"}], ",", "1", ",", "1"}], ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "ffa7206f-4bd8-4467-a140-c4106f10e8ae"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["C", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    StyleBox["i", "TI"], 
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Gamma]", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], "2"], 
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Gamma]", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], "0"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "fb5c9c4f-ec77-4485-83bc-89770b8938c8"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Alpha]", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["j", "TI"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Gamma]", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], "0"], 
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Gamma]", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["j", "TI"]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "d5e0d26a-72ca-4b21-82e7-eb6180e67cbc"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox["\[Beta]", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Gamma]", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], "0"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "f129e415-0b87-438c-b8dd-8a6d3df3f2cb"],
 ". The spinor field ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["\[CapitalPsi]", 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "efcdcc77-edba-494a-9549-a0bd108c2114"],
 " has eight components: the Dirac index ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox["d", "TI"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6287d4b3-db24-4881-b273-8ddd2ed4f6c6"],
 " (four values) and the isospin index ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox["s", "TI"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "3355ab4a-3ce6-451b-8a3c-87dfca349a2b"],
 " (up, down); a ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"4", "\[Times]", "4"}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "b337c1fc-5fcb-421f-8a8a-5238419f5a74"],
 " Dirac matrix ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox["A", "TI"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "a08470a6-0cae-4a15-92db-d31af4398052"],
 " acts on it as ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["A", "TI"], "\[CircleTimes]", 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["1",
      FontFamily->"Helvetica",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], "2"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1b183dc0-f1e9-4f69-aa70-d971b8613597"],
 " and an isospin matrix ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox["t", "TI"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "bb85d030-8598-4470-be33-bddfe8fb5d51"],
 " as ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["1",
      FontFamily->"Helvetica",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], "4"], "\[CircleTimes]", 
    StyleBox["t", "TI"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "bc4f70e6-7f38-4f93-b0f9-9d197c4210f3"],
 ". The isospin generators are ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["T", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], "\[Iota]"], "\[LongEqual]", 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["1",
      FontFamily->"Helvetica",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], "4"], "\[CircleTimes]", 
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Tau]", "\[Iota]", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "/", "2"}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "396e0c25-197a-4c64-96ef-cca95eec27b0"],
 ", the matrices of the three spin-zero pair fields are ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["K",
      FontFamily->"Helvetica",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], "\[Iota]"], "\[LongEqual]", 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["C", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Gamma]", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["ch",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[CircleTimes]", 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["E",
      FontFamily->"Helvetica",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Tau]", "\[Iota]", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "2d1c4787-2d5d-4ef5-ac75-6f13200a7420"],
 ", and the free Dirac Hamiltonian at the momentum ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox[
    OverscriptBox[
     StyleBox["q", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"], 
    StyleBox["LL",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "c82916b4-8294-47ca-92bc-51cf77d793c1"],
 " is ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["h",
      FontFamily->"Helvetica",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     SubscriptBox[
      OverscriptBox[
       StyleBox["q", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"], 
      StyleBox["LL",
       FontSlant->"Plain"]], ")"}], "\[LongEqual]", 
    UnderscriptBox["\[Sum]", 
     StyleBox["j", "TI"],
     LimitsPositioning->True], "\[ThinSpace]", 
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[Alpha]", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["j", "TI"]], 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["j", "TI"]], "+", 
    SubscriptBox["\[Beta]", 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["m", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "cde33d71-4e43-4270-a1e7-9f94d0cbc952"],
 "."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"b7925ea1-a908-4c18-b2d8-d58922e1d477"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["The author's conventions (the Standard Model).",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " The covariant derivative of the Higgs doublet is ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["D", "TI"], "\[Mu]", 
     StyleBox["SM",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
    SuperscriptBox["\[CapitalPhi]", 
     StyleBox["SM",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{
      SubscriptBox["\[PartialD]", "\[Mu]"], "+", 
      StyleBox["ig", "TI"], "\[ThinSpace]", 
      UnderoverscriptBox["\[Sum]", 
       RowBox[{
        StyleBox["a", "TI"], "\[LongEqual]", "1"}], "3",
       LimitsPositioning->True], "\[ThinSpace]", 
      FractionBox[
       SuperscriptBox["\[Tau]", 
        StyleBox["a", "TI"]], "2"], 
      SubsuperscriptBox[
       StyleBox["W", "TI"], "\[Mu]", 
       StyleBox["a", "TI"]], "+", 
      StyleBox["i", "TI"], 
      SuperscriptBox[
       StyleBox["g", "TI"], "\[Prime]"], 
      SuperscriptBox[
       StyleBox["Y", "TI"], 
       StyleBox["SM",
        FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
      SubscriptBox[
       StyleBox["B", "TI"], "\[Mu]"]}], ")"}], 
    SuperscriptBox["\[CapitalPhi]", 
     StyleBox["SM",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "97a408a2-20a0-4319-ac61-f3d3126cebb1"],
 " with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["Y", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["SM",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    FractionBox["1", "2"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "40bd2b72-2f47-43ea-a9ee-00bda6c42e19"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["Q", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["SM",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    SuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["T", "TI"], 
     RowBox[{"3", ",", 
      StyleBox["SM",
       FontSlant->"Plain"]}]], "+", 
    SuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["Y", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["SM",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "b298e906-55b6-4292-bc81-e613ac604ec2"],
 "; the fields of definite mass are ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["W", "TI"], "\[Mu]", "\[PlusMinus]"], "\[LongEqual]", 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{
      SubsuperscriptBox[
       StyleBox["W", "TI"], "\[Mu]", "1"], "\[MinusPlus]", 
      StyleBox["i", "TI"], 
      SubsuperscriptBox[
       StyleBox["W", "TI"], "\[Mu]", "2"]}], ")"}], "/", 
    SqrtBox["2"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "f9eb677a-537a-4aec-b25d-8f1fca67a34e"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["Z", "TI"], "\[Mu]"], "\[LongEqual]", 
    StyleBox["cos",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], "\[ThinSpace]", 
    SubscriptBox["\[Theta]", 
     StyleBox["W", "TI"]], 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["W", "TI"], "\[Mu]", "3"], "-", 
    StyleBox["sin",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], "\[ThinSpace]", 
    SubscriptBox["\[Theta]", 
     StyleBox["W", "TI"]], 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["B", "TI"], "\[Mu]"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "3549a2f0-369b-4231-bb9e-56abc1135f75"],
 " and the photon ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["A", "TI"], "\[Mu]"], "\[LongEqual]", 
    StyleBox["sin",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], "\[ThinSpace]", 
    SubscriptBox["\[Theta]", 
     StyleBox["W", "TI"]], 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["W", "TI"], "\[Mu]", "3"], "+", 
    StyleBox["cos",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], "\[ThinSpace]", 
    SubscriptBox["\[Theta]", 
     StyleBox["W", "TI"]], 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["B", "TI"], "\[Mu]"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "b2509af9-8029-4467-b000-65ccb67874fa"],
 ", with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["e", "TI"], "\[LongEqual]", 
    StyleBox["g", "TI"], "\[ThinSpace]", 
    StyleBox["sin",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], "\[ThinSpace]", 
    SubscriptBox["\[Theta]", 
     StyleBox["W", "TI"]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "e42df1cb-2238-4b23-9468-91f2085626c3"],
 "; with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"\[LeftAngleBracket]", 
     SuperscriptBox["\[CapitalPhi]", 
      StyleBox["SM",
       FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[RightAngleBracket]"}], "\[LongEqual]", 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{"0", ",", 
      StyleBox["v", "TI"]}], ")"}], "/", 
    SqrtBox["2"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5ac140bd-734a-4ad0-ab25-39b66c1baaf6"],
 " the masses are ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["M", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["W", "TI"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    StyleBox["gv", "TI"], "/", "2"}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "32df2078-99a8-4321-86b1-4d62261064de"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["M", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["Z", "TI"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
    SqrtBox[
     RowBox[{
      SuperscriptBox[
       StyleBox["g", "TI"], "2"], "+", 
      SuperscriptBox[
       StyleBox["g", "TI"], 
       RowBox[{"\[Prime]", "2"}]]}]], "\[ThinSpace]", 
    StyleBox["v", "TI"], "/", "2"}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6480101e-c3d5-4c76-81be-894f5e2ddb99"],
 ", and the photon is massless. All GEE covariant derivatives of the solution \
use the same sign, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"+", 
    StyleBox["i", "TI"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "3bdd7182-1f5f-4114-9781-e7ec8569e656"],
 " in front of every coupling."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"808f0f73-59e0-4da2-b2b4-0e0b2bcedac5"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The next cell defines these matrices, the bi-quaternions and bi-octonions \
of Section I.2, the Lorentz matrices, the spinor matrices and the operators \
of the Fock space of one point. They are the same objects as those of the \
Rust library ",
 StyleBox["sfcore",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " and of the Python module ",
 StyleBox["sfcommon.py",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 ", written here with the functions of the Wolfram Language."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"6482c173-feaf-487d-88a4-c8febbd8c1a8"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
    "the", " ", "mass", " ", "of", " ", "the", " ", "spinor", " ", "field"}], 
    ",", " ", "m_LL", ",", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
     "in", " ", "units", " ", "of", " ", "the", " ", "cutoff", " ", 
      "Lambda_LL"}], " ", "=", " ", "1"}]}], " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"mLL", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"1", "/", "5"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"sig", "[", 
        RowBox[{"[", 
         RowBox[{"p", " ", "+", " ", "1"}], "]"}], "]"}], " ", "is", " ", 
       RowBox[{"sigma", "^", "LL_p"}], " ", 
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"p", " ", "=", " ", "0"}], ",", " ", "1", ",", " ", "2", ",",
          " ", "3"}], ")"}]}], ":", " ", 
      RowBox[{
      "sigma_", "0", " ", "is", " ", "the", " ", "2", " ", "x", " ", "2", " ",
        "unit", " ", "matrix"}]}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"sigma_", "1"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"sigma_", "2"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"sigma_", "3", " ", "the", " ", "Pauli", " ", "matrices"}]}], 
    " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"sig", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"IdentityMatrix", "[", "2", "]"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"PauliMatrix", "[", "1", "]"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"PauliMatrix", "[", "2", "]"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"PauliMatrix", "[", "3", "]"}]}], "}"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"sigbar", "[", 
        RowBox[{"[", 
         RowBox[{"p", " ", "+", " ", "1"}], "]"}], "]"}], " ", "is", " ", 
       "sigma"}], "-", 
      RowBox[{"bar_p", ":", " ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"sigma_", "0", " ", "and"}], " ", "-", "sigma_j"}]}]}], ",", 
     " ", 
     RowBox[{
     "the", " ", "blocks", " ", "of", " ", "the", " ", "Dirac", " ", 
      "matrices", " ", "below", " ", "the", " ", "diagonal"}]}], " ", "*)"}], 
   "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"sigbar", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"sig", "[", 
        RowBox[{"[", "1", "]"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"-", 
        RowBox[{"sig", "[", 
         RowBox[{"[", "2", "]"}], "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"-", 
        RowBox[{"sig", "[", 
         RowBox[{"[", "3", "]"}], "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"-", 
        RowBox[{"sig", "[", 
         RowBox[{"[", "4", "]"}], "]"}]}]}], "}"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"eLL", " ", "is", " ", "E_LL"}], " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"i", " ", "sigma_", "2"}], " ", "=", " ", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"0", ",", " ", "1"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"-", "1"}], ",", " ", "0"}], "}"}]}], "}"}]}]}], " ", 
    "*)"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"eLL", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"0", ",", " ", "1"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"-", "1"}], ",", " ", "0"}], "}"}]}], "}"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
     "etaLL", " ", "is", " ", "the", " ", "Minkowski", " ", "metric", " ", 
      RowBox[{"eta", "^", "LL"}]}], " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"diag", 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{"1", ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"-", "1"}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"-", "1"}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"-", "1"}]}], ")"}]}]}], " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"etaLL", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"DiagonalMatrix", "[", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"1", ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"-", "1"}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"-", "1"}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"-", "1"}]}], "}"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"levi", "[", 
        RowBox[{"a", ",", " ", "b", ",", " ", "c"}], "]"}], " ", "is", " ", 
       "the", " ", "Levi"}], "-", 
      RowBox[{"Civita", " ", "symbol", " ", 
       RowBox[{"epsilon", "^", "LL"}], " ", "of", " ", "the", " ", "indices", 
       " ", "1"}]}], ",", " ", "2", ",", " ", "3"}], " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"levi", "[", 
      RowBox[{"a_", ",", " ", "b_", ",", " ", "c_"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Signature", "[", 
