  "PASS ", "WF-5a", "  deviation ", "0", " (tolerance ", "0", "): ", 
   "D1: the Pauli-Guersey generators commute with the Lorentz generators \
(exact)", "   [the same check: Rust ", "F-5a", ", Python ", "F-5a", "]"],
  Editable->False]], "Print",
 CellChangeTimes->{4.0042626385662737`*^9},
 CellLabel->
  "During evaluation of \
In[74]:=",ExpressionUUID->"f5f736b1-bb7c-4723-b5af-182debd6a276"],

